    {
      "rank": 11,
      "row_id": 172565,
      "chunk_id": "3741d35c32a9_4",
      "doc_id": "3741d35c32a9",
      "text": "The battery life isn’t great but is an improvement on the 5 and 6, and moreover you can now buy a phone case incorporating 24-hours of extra battery life, though it makes the phone more bulky 2. The price of the 7 is high for a buyer on a modest income, but as usual you get what you pay for and this is a premium product It’s easy to see why Apple maintains market leadership with such excellent products and back-up service through their funky high street/mall Apple stores full of knowledgeable, intelligent and helpful staff. Make sure you buy a screen protector and a silicone rubber-back case to protect the sides of the phone in case it gets accidentally dropped on the street – which it eventually will.",
      "score": 0.03221858552321304,
      "brand": "Apple",
      "model": "iPhone 7",
      "rating": 5,
      "timestamp": "2017-07-30",
      "aspect_tags": [
        "battery",
        "display",
        "service"
      ],
      "helpful_votes": 2,
      "verified": false,
      "is_renewed": false,
      "source_url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1EXQY4",
      "bm25_score": 4.070366859436035,
      "bm25_rank": 19,
      "dense_score": 0.5896375775337219,
      "dense_rank": 28,
      "aspect_boosted": true,
      "rrf_score": 0.02402186421173763,
      "rrf_normalized": 0.7326668584579977
    },
    {
      "rank": 12,
      "row_id": 245613,
      "chunk_id": "c1e01df4c15d_0",
      "doc_id": "c1e01df4c15d",
      "text": "Great Phone, Just Be Sure to Get New Battery. The phone arrived in (practically) new condition. From day one I noticed the battery life was poor, so I took the advice from another reviewer and had a new battery installed by Apple. While at Apple, the technician checked over the phone (inside and out) and said that the phone was in good condition and ran as it was supposed to. I’ve had the phone for a little over two weeks now and I’d say I’m pretty happy with the purchase. I bought a refurbished phone from Amazon about a year ago, but it was a little more worn and did not function properly. So I’m happy this one worked out AND that Amazon has a great return policy for the phones if it doesn’t perform as it should. It gave me a huge piece of mind.",
      "score": 0.03214967598732165,
      "brand": "Apple",
      "model": "iPhone 7",
      "rating": 5,
      "timestamp": "2019-06-07",
      "aspect_tags": [
        "battery"
      ],
